Mods: {
 XianXia: {
  Items: {
   DaoTransformationSeal: {
    DisplayName: Artifact Dao Transformation Seal
    Tooltip: "Use near a Dao Severing Altar to bind a supported, inscribed refinement-3 awakened weapon to the current world route. Requires Dao Severing and defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core; confirmation costs 1 seal and 36 low-grade stones. See each target for its effects."
   }
  }
  DaoArtifacts: {
   FlameTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nActive only in a matching-route world after defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core\nNominal base damage grows from 24 to 120; keeps prefix, inscription, refinement, awakening and sect heritage\nBase ordinary cost 12, or 9 for Star Abyss; Sever Heaven adds 15% damage\nInactive routes keep their record but revert to awakened base cost 3 and original damage. Player cost modifiers still apply. No active skill."

   AlreadyTransformed: This item already has a Dao transformation and cannot change routes. No materials spent.
   NeedAwakening: Refine this item to level 3 and awaken it first. No materials spent.
   NeedInscription: The item must retain an inscription. No materials spent.
   NeedRealm: You must reach Dao Severing to transform this item. No materials spent.
   NeedCore: Defeat the Old Heaven Dao Core in this world first. No materials spent.
   NeedWorldRoute: This world has no valid ending route. Use Route Material near the Dao Severing Altar to choose one.
   Cost: Costs 1 seal and 36 Low Grade Spirit Stones near a Dao Severing Altar. One transformation; preserves the item, prefix, inscription and awakening.
   Selection: "Target: {0}\nWorld route: {1}\nRequires Dao Severing, an inscribed / level-three / awakened eligible artifact, and defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core. Confirm costs 1 seal + 36 stones. Existing transformation cannot change route."
   Row: "{0}. {1} · Dao: {2}"
   Tooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly works in matching-route worlds that defeated the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows to sword 150 / array 80; prefixes and existing bonuses remain\nNormal costs: sword 20 / array 28, or 16 / 22 for Star Abyss; player multipliers still apply\nRebuild pulse heals 40 and sword burst heals the owner for 20; Sever adds 15% damage and bursts for triple weapon damage; Star Abyss active skills cost less and add 8 spiritual pressure"
   MoonTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly active in matching-route worlds after defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows from 220 to 280; prefixes, refinement, awakening and heritage bonuses remain\nNormal base cost 18, or 14 for Star Abyss; skills keep the shared 20-second cooldown\nRebuild: three shards at 200% weapon damage, 36 base energy, heal owner up to 20\nSever: +15% weapon damage; three shards at 250%, 48 base energy\nStar Abyss: three shards at 200%, 30 base energy, +8 spiritual pressure per successful cast; player energy multipliers apply"
   WheelTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly active in matching-route worlds after defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows from 92 to 130; prefixes, refinement, awakening and heritage remain\nNormal base cost 14, or 11 for Star Abyss; skills share a 20-second cooldown\nRebuild: five 200% wheels, 48 base energy, heal owner up to 20\nSever: +15% weapon damage; five 250% wheels, 60 base energy\nStar Abyss: five 200% wheels, 40 base energy, +8 spiritual pressure per successful cast; player energy multipliers apply"
   HammerTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly active in matching-route worlds after defeating the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows from 54 to 84; prefixes, inscription, refinement and awakening remain\nNormal base cost 16, or 12 for Star Abyss; skills share a 20-second cooldown\nRebuild: three 225% hammers, 40 base energy, heal owner up to 20\nSever: +15% weapon damage; three 275% hammers, 54 base energy\nStar Abyss: three 225% hammers, 34 base energy, +8 spiritual pressure on success; each hammer keeps its one half-damage impact; player energy multipliers apply"
   ThunderTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly active in matching-route worlds that defeated the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows from 54 to 90; prefixes, inscription, refinement, awakening and sect heritage remain\nNormal base spirit cost 10, or 8 for Star Abyss; shared skill cooldown 20 seconds\nRebuild: three strikes at 200% weapon damage each, base cost 36, heals the owner up to 20 on success\nSever: adds 15% weapon damage; three 250% strikes, base cost 48\nStar Abyss: three 200% strikes, base cost 30, adds 8 spiritual pressure on success; player cost multipliers apply"
   WardTooltip: "Dao transformation: {0}\nOnly active in matching-route worlds that defeated the Old Heaven Dao Core\nBase damage grows from 156 to 210; prefix, inscription, refinement and awakening remain\nNormal base cost 30, or 24 for Star Abyss\nWard keeps 3 seconds, 35% damage reduction, 12 defense and a shared 20-second cooldown\nRebuild: base ward cost 24, heals up to 20 on success\nSever: adds 15% weapon damage, base ward cost 30\nStar Abyss: base ward cost 20, adds 8 pressure on success; player cost multipliers apply"
   ChangedInventory: The equipment, material or world route changed. Nothing consumed.
